{"detail": {"templateUuid": "e4408dad95204e9181a15578c942c8fd", "projectUuid": "ff2fed7e758140c18a7162a78c9e70f2", "name": "《摆》| 它摆了，你要不要也摆五分钟", "description": "欢迎光临「牙科枕所」- 001\n这里不开处方，只有一些原创的枕边故事提供一点微弱的困意，不用紧张，挑个舒服的姿势躺下就好。\n处方：《摆》\n小镇尽头的修钟铺，每天深夜都亮着灯。 挂钟、座钟、怀表……小镇居民坏掉的时间，都会被送到这里。钟表匠从不让人等待，他总能把别人的时间修补得完好如初。 铺子里各种并不整齐的滴答声，就是他每天生活的全部。\n唯独他自己的立柜钟，一直卡地停摆在阴影里。\n这是一个关于深夜的小故事。 也是一次属于钟表匠自己的，短暂的停摆。\n今晚，时间先不修了。", "coverUrl": "/assets/2e902ac2c1bf6220.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d7688c8a7ba547c7a172eaffea55d787/0644f3abb62a60600b114eb637b6b958702ec7a9.mp4", "snapshotId": 46460, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 6088373, "ownerUuid": "d7688c8a7ba547c7a172eaffea55d787", "avatar": "/assets/2387e3712d0c1160.webp", "nickname": "埋伏牙", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 65, "tags": [{"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3061, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "4. 无问西东", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3061", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6aa7eb32000000001203f27d?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=YBRr05wdVvq_AHM8IeIMN2wFpqfBEymAASswWqdA4hqIw=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年09月14日 20:45", "updateAt": "2026年09月20日 23:02", "publishAt": "2026年09月15日 14:28", "playCount": 186, "viewCreationProcessCount": 59, "copyCanvasCount": 10, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/e4408dad95204